abstract: >
  VisualPatchWorld learns structure-aware executable programmatic world models
  from expert trajectories and evaluates them with fair frozen planners on
  LeWM environments (Two-room, Reacher, PushT, Cube).
keywords:
  - world models
  - program induction
  - planning
  - visual abstraction
